# =============================================================================
# FILE SUMMARY
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git ignore rules: dependency folders and virtual environments, secrets
# (.env files except the examples), build output, and - importantly - raw
# biometric samples exported from MongoDB, which must stay out of version
# control.  Trained models and calibration files ARE committed so the demo
# works out of the box.
# =============================================================================
